<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="6be4437d">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Test scripts for automated testing are&amp;nbsp;written in a variety of computer programming languages
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Developing test scripts for manual testing may not be necessary when performing manual testing if step-by-step
        instructions to implement the test execution conditions are already defined in the test case
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Automated test scripts are often reused for regression testing
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        A test case usually has one but could have more than one corresponding test script
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
